# 2.0.0b1

- Add key press/hold, menu, alert, aspect-ratio, profile, and option helpers.
- Add profile/page enumeration and option query/change/inherit commands.
- Read complete enumeration replies on separate connections.
- Quote text parameters and reject command-injection characters.
- Validate message durations and volume ranges.
- Declare Python >=3.11; skip PyPI publication for GitHub prereleases.

Breaking changes: unsupported Python versions are rejected during installation;
invalid command text, negative durations, and out-of-range volume values raise
ValueError. KeyHold is one long-press event, not continuous navigation.

